<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.62 vs   0.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.96 vs   1.04</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.80 vs   1.03</p>
<p> Sales		   14.41 vs  13.28</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.30 vs  15.87</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	31.81 vs  24.53</p>
<p> Operating profit    30.33 vs  23.99</p>
<p> Sales		  183.84 vs 152.43</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Wroclaw</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
